YOUR_STRAPI_API_TOKEN_HERE

# Instructions:
# 1. Create API token in Strapi admin: Settings → API Tokens → Create
# 2. Copy this file to: strapi.token (remove .example)
# 3. Replace YOUR_STRAPI_API_TOKEN_HERE with your actual token
# 4. Run: node scripts/seed-all-data.js
#
# Note: strapi.token is gitignored and will not be committed
